  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the project is to reduce poverty and enhance the quality of life of beneficiary rural communities. The objective is to strengthen the capacity of rural communities to enhance their quality of life by improving their productive assets, rural infrastructure and access to key support services from private and public sources.</narrative>
